-- Photographs for the menu, matched to the live Foodics menu by item name.
--
-- GENERATED by backend/db/tools/import-foodics-images.mjs — do not hand-edit.
--
-- The column holds a path into this site's own /menu assets, not a Foodics URL:
-- the pictures are re-encoded and shipped with the frontend so the menu page
-- makes no third-party request and stays cheap on mobile data. Staff can still
-- paste an absolute URL from the editor for a one-off item.
